.TH "LINTO-QUARTO" 1

.SH "Quarto workflow"
.PP
The \fBquarto\fP group provides citation extraction, rendering helpers, output
browsing, and setup commands\. Use \fBlinto help quarto\fP for the current command
list\.
.PP
Typical invocations:
.RS
.PP
.nf
linto quarto citations \-\-help
linto quarto render \-\-help
linto quarto setup \-\-help
linto quarto setup\-document \-\-help
linto quarto setup\-lettre \-\-help
.fi
.RE
.PP
Citation extraction can produce YAML or CSV and supports ordering options; see
\fBlinto quarto citations \-\-help\fP for the supported flags\. Quarto commands may
invoke the Quarto CLI and may read or write files in the current project\.
